{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2021-09-28 16:30:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK ELECTS BETH FORD AND KRISTIN PECK TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK) HAS ELECTED BETH FORD, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF LAND O'LAKES, INC., AND KRISTIN PECK, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF ZOETIS INC. – TO THE COMPANY'S BOARD AS INDEPENDENT DIRECTORS. LAURENCE D. FINK, CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF BLACKROCK, SAID: “BETH AND KRISTIN ARE RECOGNIZED LEADERS IN THEIR RESPECTIVE INDUSTRIES, AND THEY BRING A WIDE RANGE OF VALUABLE PERSPECTIVES AND EXPERIENCES THAT WILL HELP BLACKROCK AND THE BOARD NAVIGATE THE FUT"}